    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exploration-based adventure game where you must identify anomalies and choose the correct path to progress. Set in an eerie, surreal space, you'll navigate a world inspired by Backrooms, liminal spaces, and the mysterious Exit 8. With dozens of anomalies to observe and interpret, your intuition and keen observation skills will be your greatest assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unsettling environment, subtle shifts or striking anomalies can become the key to survival. Be vigilant, as even the smallest change may hold the answer to your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over dozens of anomalies, randomly appearing to keep you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gameplay loop focused on observing and choosing the correct path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and eerie liminal space to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-completion feature to track and complete all anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supported for gameplay streaming and live commentary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this strange world? Or perhaps, there is no exit for the old man after all...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an exploration-based adventure game where you must identify anomalies and choose the correct path to progress. Set in an eerie, surreal space, you'll navigate a world inspired by Backrooms, liminal spaces, and the mysterious Exit 8. With dozens of anomalies to observe and interpret, your intuition and keen observation skills will be your greatest assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unsettling environment, subtle shifts or striking anomalies can become the key to survival. Be vigilant, as even the smallest change may hold the answer to your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over dozens of anomalies, randomly appearing to keep you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gameplay loop focused on observing and choosing the correct path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and eerie liminal space to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-completion feature to track and complete all anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supported for gameplay streaming and live commentary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape this strange world? Or perhaps, there is no exit for the old man after all...</p>",
    "short_description": "This work is inspired by Exit 8, Backrooms, and liminal spaces - environments that evoke an unsettling sense of the familiar yet strange. However, is there any way out for the old man? No, there isn't.",
